<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Raymond's_Tomb> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Raymond's tomb** is the tomb of [Michel Joachim Marie Raymond](:Michel_Joachim_Marie_Raymond), a [French](:France) general in the army of 2nd Nizam - [Nizam Ali Khan, Asaf Jah II](:Nizam_Ali_Khan%2C_Asaf_Jah_II). The tomb, located in [Hyderabad, India](:Hyderabad%2C_India) is a black granite tombstone, conical, about 7 metres high and it has the initials JR on it. The pavilion was built by the [Nizam](:Nizam) and collapsed in October 2001 in heavy rain."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
