<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Suprunov_Mansion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Suprunov Mansion** (Template:Lang-ru is a building in [Rostov-on-Don](:Rostov-on-Don) located on [Pushkinskaya Street](:Pushkinskaya_Street_%28Rostov-on-Don%29) (house 79). The mansion was built at the beginning of the 20th century and belonged to the Rostov grain-grower and a stud to Ivan Aleksandrovich Suprunov. The building has the status of an object of cultural heritage of regional value."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
