<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ouidah> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Ouidah** () or **Whydah** (; *Ouidah*, *Juida*, and *Juda* by the French; *Ajudá* by the Portuguese; and *Fida* by the Dutch) and known locally as **Glexwe**, formerly the chief port of the [Kingdom of Whydah](:Kingdom_of_Whydah), is a city on [the coast](:Atlantic_Ocean) of the Republic of [Benin](:Benin). The commune covers an area of 364 km2 (141 sq mi) and as of 2002 had a population of 76,555 people."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
