<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Monument_to_Cánovas_del_Castillo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The ***Monument to Cánovas del Castillo*** ([Spanish](:Spanish_language): *Monumento a Cánovas del Castillo*) is an instance of public art located in [Madrid](:Madrid), Spain. The monument consists of a bronze statue of [Antonio Cánovas del Castillo](:Antonio_C%C3%A1novas_del_Castillo) by [Joaquín Bilbao](:Joaqu%C3%ADn_Bilbao) at the top of a pedestal designed by [José Grases Riera](:Jos%C3%A9_Grases_Riera) that features additional sculptural elements by Bilbao."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
