<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Galacha> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Galacha** (Template:Lang-az or **Shamil-Gala** (Template:Lang-az is a round tower located near the village of [İlisu](:%C4%B0lisu) in the [Gakh region](:Qakh_District) of [Azerbaijan](:Azerbaijan). The tower was built in the beginning of the 19th century during the [Russian troops](:Imperial_Russian_Army) advancing into the mountains. According to the order of the [Cabinet of Ministers of the Republic of Azerbaijan](:Cabinet_of_Azerbaijan) on the historical and cultural monument, it is considered an architectural monument of local importance."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
