<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Profitable_house_of_I._M._Trofimenko> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Profitable house of I. M. Trofimenko (Russian: Доходный дом И. М. Трофименко) is a mansion built in the beginning of the 20th century in Oktyabrsky district of Rostov-on-Don executed in eclecticism style. It is located at 73 Prosveshcheniya Street. The building is an object of cultural heritage of local value. Originally in the building, the profitable house, then paper-mill with printing house was placed. Nowadays I. M. Trofimenko's house occupies Lyceum № 33 of a name of the Rostov regiment of a national militia."@en .
