<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Angel_of_Victory_(Valdepeñas)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Angel of Victory and Peace (Spanish: Ángel de la Victoria y de la Paz) or Angel of Victory, also referred to by some as Ángel del Fascismo (\"Angel of Fascism\"), is a ruined monument in Valdepeñas, Spain. It was a Francoist memorial designed by Juan de Ávalos that consisted of a colossal statue of an angel holding a sword. The monument was made of a reinforced stone sided by two poles. It was partially destroyed in 1976."@en .
