<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Leeds> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Leeds is a city in the county of West Yorkshire, England. The city lies in the valley of the River Aire in the eastern foothills of the Pennines. The city is the largest settlement in the county with a population of 516,298, while the larger City of Leeds metropolitan borough had a population of 812,000 (2021 estimate). The city is part of the West Yorkshire Built-up Area, the fourth-largest urban area in the United Kingdom with 1.7 million inhabitants."@en .
