<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bucharest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bucharest (UK: /ˌbuːkəˈrɛst/ BOO-kə-REST, US: /ˈbuːkərɛst/ -⁠rest; Romanian: București [bukuˈreʃtʲ]) is the capital and largest city of Romania, as well as its cultural, industrial, and financial centre. It is located in the southeast of the country, on the banks of the Dâmbovița River, less than 60 km (37.3 mi) north of the Danube River and the Bulgarian border. The city has a number of large convention facilities, educational institutes, cultural venues, traditional 'shopping arcades' and recreational areas."@en .
