<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Joaquín_Bilbao> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Joaquín Bilbao Martínez** (August 27, 1864 – January 30, 1934) was a Spanish sculptor. The [equestrian statue](:Equestrian_statue) of [Ferdinand III of Castile](:Ferdinand_III_of_Castile) in the [Plaza Nueva, Seville](:Plaza_Nueva%2C_Seville), opposite the Town Hall, was sculpted by him."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
