<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Statue_of_Alexander_von_Humboldt_(Chicago)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Alexander von Humboldt statue** is a [monumental statue](:Monumental_statue) in [Chicago](:Chicago), [Illinois](:Illinois), [United States](:United_States). Located in [Humboldt Park](:Humboldt_Park_%28Chicago_park%29), a major [urban park](:Urban_park) in the [Humboldt Park](:Humboldt_Park%2C_Chicago) neighborhood, the statue depicts [Alexander von Humboldt](:Alexander_von_Humboldt), a [Prussian](:Prussian) [polymath](:Polymath) and the park's namesake. The statue was dedicated in 1892."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
