<http://dbpedia.org/resource/William_Thomas_(architect)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "William Thomas (c. 1799 – 26 December 1860) was an Anglo-Canadian architect. His son William Tutin Thomas (1829–1892) was also an architect, working mostly in Montreal, Quebec."@en .
