<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Sacred_Heart_of_Jesus_(Roxas,_Capiz)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Sacred Heart of Jesus** is a giant statue of [Jesus Christ](:Jesus_Christ) in [Roxas City](:Roxas_City) in the [Philippines](:Philippines). The 132-foot (40 m) monument, said to be the tallest of its kind in the Philippines, was built in 2015 within the [Pueblo de Panay](:Pueblo_de_Panay) [mixed-use development](:Mixed-use_development)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
