<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Treasury_of_Cyrene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Treasury of Cyrene** (*Treasury of the Cyreneans*) was a building in the [sanctuary of Apollo](:Temple_of_Apollo_%28Delphi%29) in [Delphi](:Delphi). The [treasury](:Treasury) was possibly built as a token of gratitude for a large endowment of wheat offered to Delphi's inhabitants during a lean period."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
