<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Frederic_Chopin_Monument,_Warsaw> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Frederic Chopin Monument in Warsaw** ([Polish](:Polish_language): *Pomnik Fryderyka Chopina w Warszawie*) is a large bronze statue of [Frédéric Chopin](:Fr%C3%A9d%C3%A9ric_Chopin) (1810–1849) that now stands in the upper part of [Warsaw](:Warsaw)'s [Royal Baths Park](:Royal_Baths_Park) (also known as Łazienki Park), adjacent to *Aleje Ujazdowskie* ([Ujazdów Avenue](:Ujazd%C3%B3w_Avenue%29)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
