<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Roshnai_Gate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Roshnai Gate (Urdu: روشنائی دروازہ, lit. 'Gate of Lights') is one of the thirteen gates within the Walled City of Lahore in Lahore, Punjab, Pakistan. It was the main entry into Lahore for emperors and nobles during the Mughal, and later Sikh period."@en .
