<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Zalău> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Zalău (Romanian pronunciation: [zaˈləw], unofficial and former official name: Romanian: Zălau (Romanian pronunciation: [zəlaˈw]; German: Zillenmarkt or Waltenberg, Hungarian: Zilah, Turkish: Zile) is the seat of Sălaj County, Romania. In 2011, its estimated population was 56,202."@en .
