<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Statue_of_Alexander_von_Humboldt_(Chicago)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Alexander von Humboldt statue is a monumental statue in Chicago, Illinois, United States. Located in Humboldt Park, a major urban park in the Humboldt Park neighborhood, the statue depicts Alexander von Humboldt, a Prussian polymath and the park's namesake. The statue was dedicated in 1892."@en .
