<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Madani_Square> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Madani Square**, (Template:Lang-bn, also known as **Madani Chattar** or **Madani Point**, is a [monument](:Monument) in Nayasarak Road in [Sylhet](:Sylhet) built to commemorate [Hussain Ahmed Madani](:Hussain_Ahmed_Madani)'s contributions towards [dawah](:Dawah) in [Sylhet, Bangladesh](:Sylhet%2C_Bangladesh). It was completed and opened on 18 February 2019 replacing the junction marking *Nayasarak Point*."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
