<http://dbpedia.org/resource/County_Kildare> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "County Kildare (Irish: Contae Chill Dara) is a county in Ireland. It is in the province of Leinster and is part of the Eastern and Midland Region. It is named after the town of Kildare. Kildare County Council is the local authority for the county, which has a population of 222,504."@en .
