<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Roddick_Gates> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[45°30′13″N 73°34′29″W﻿ / ﻿45.50361°N 73.57472°W﻿ / 45.50361; -73.57472](https://geohack.toolforge.org/geohack.php?pagename=Roddick_Gates&params=45_30_13_N_73_34_29_W_)The **Roddick Gates**, also known as the **Roddick Memorial Gates**, are [monumental](:Monument) gates in [Montreal](:Montreal) that serve as the main entrance to the [McGill University](:McGill_University) downtown campus. They are located on [Sherbrooke Street West](:Sherbrooke_Street_West) and are at the northern end of the very short but broad [McGill College Avenue](:McGill_College_Avenue), which starts at [Place Ville-Marie](:Place_Ville-Marie)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
