<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Monument_to_Federico_García_Lorca_(Madrid)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Federico García Lorca or the Monument to Federico García Lorca is an instance of public art in Madrid, Spain. Located at the Plaza de Santa Ana, in front of the Teatro Español, it consists of a bronze statue of the aforementioned poet and playwright."@en .
