<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Palo_Alto,_California> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Palo Alto (/ˌpæloʊ ˈæltoʊ/; Spanish for \"tall stick\") is a charter city in the northwestern corner of Santa Clara County, California, United States, in the San Francisco Bay Area, named after a coastal redwood tree known as El Palo Alto."@en .
