<http://dbpedia.org/resource/McGill_College_Avenue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "McGill College Avenue (officially in French: avenue McGill College) is a street in downtown Montreal, Quebec, Canada. Named for McGill University, the street was widened in the 1980s and transformed into a scenic avenue with McGill's Roddick Gates on Sherbrooke Street at its north end and the Place Ville Marie plaza at its south end."@en .
