<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Józef_Poniatowski_Monument,_Warsaw> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Prince **Józef Poniatowski Monument in Warsaw** ([Polish](:Polish_language): *Pomnik księcia Józefa Poniatowskiego w Warszawie*) is a monument currently located at 46/48 [Krakowskie Przedmieście](:Krakowskie_Przedmie%C5%9Bcie) in the courtyard of the [Presidential Palace](:Presidential_Palace%2C_Warsaw). Created by [Rome](:Rome)-based Danish sculptor [Bertel Thorvaldsen](:Bertel_Thorvaldsen) in 1829, it depicts [Józef Poniatowski](:J%C3%B3zef_Poniatowski) (1763–1813) riding and horse and dressed as [Roman](:Ancient_Rome) general."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
