<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Gateway_of_Dreams> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "***Gateway of Dreams*** is a public [monument](:Monument) in [Atlanta](:Atlanta), [Georgia](:Georgia_%28U%2ES%2E_state%29), [United States](:United_States). Located in [Centennial Olympic Park](:Centennial_Olympic_Park), the monument honors [Pierre de Coubertin](:Pierre_de_Coubertin), the father of the modern [Olympic Games](:Olympic_Games). The monument was dedicated in 1996."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
