<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Angel_of_Victory_(Valdepeñas)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The ***Angel of Victory and Peace*** (Template:Lang-es or ***Angel of Victory***, also referred to by some as ***Ángel del Fascismo*** (\"Angel of Fascism\"), is a ruined monument in [Valdepeñas](:Valdepe%C3%B1as), Spain. It was a [Francoist](:Francoist) memorial designed by [Juan de Ávalos](:Juan_de_%C3%81valos) that consisted of a colossal statue of an angel holding a sword. The monument was made of a reinforced stone sided by two poles. It was partially destroyed in 1976."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
