<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Gardabani_Municipality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Gardabani (Georgian: გარდაბნის მუნიციპალიტეტი, Gardabnis Municiṕaliťeťi) is a municipality in Georgia's southern region Kvemo Kartli. It covers an area of 1,212.2 km2 (468 sq mi). As of 2021 it had a population of 80,329 people. The city of Gardabani is its administrative centre."@en .
