<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Wisconsin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Wisconsin (/wɪˈskɒnsɪn/) is a state in the upper Midwestern United States. Wisconsin is the 25th-largest state by total area and the 20th-most populous. It is bordered by Minnesota to the west, Iowa to the southwest, Illinois to the south, Lake Michigan to the east, Michigan to the northeast, and Lake Superior to the north."@en .
