<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Husainabad_Clock_Tower> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Husainabad Clock Tower** is a [clock tower](:Clock_tower) located in the [Lucknow](:Lucknow) city of [India](:India). It was constructed in 1881 by Hussainabad Trust to mark the arrival of Sir [George Couper](:Sir_George_Couper%2C_2nd_Baronet), the first lieutenant governor of the United Province of Avadh. It was built at a cost of Rs. 1.75 lakhs."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
