<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Zebrnjak> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Zebrnjak Memorial** (Template:Lang-sr is a [war memorial](:War_memorial) commemorate the [Battle of Kumanovo](:Battle_of_Kumanovo) , fought in 1912 as part of the [First Balkan War](:First_Balkan_War) . It is situated on the battlefield, close to the village of [Mlado Nagoričane](:Mlado_Nagori%C4%8Dane), near [Kumanovo](:Kumanovo), [North Macedonia](:North_Macedonia)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
