<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Lahore> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Lahore (/ləˈhɔːr/; Punjabi: لہور [lɔː˨ɾə̆]; Urdu: لاہور; [lɑːˈɦɔːɾ]) is the capital of the Pakistani province of Punjab, is Pakistan's 2nd largest city after Karachi, and is the 26th largest city in the world. Lahore is the largest city of Punjab. Lahore is one of Pakistan's wealthiest cities with an estimated GDP (PPP) of $84 billion as of 2019. It is the largest city and recent historic, modern day cultural centre of the wider Punjab region, and is one of Pakistan's most socially liberal, progressive, and cosmopolitan cities."@en .
