<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Abylai_Khan_(monument)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Monument to Abylai Khan in Almaty** ([Russian](:Russian_language): Памятник Абылай Хана, *[tr.](:Romanization_of_Russian) pamiatnik abylai khanu*) is a monument dedicated to the Kazakh statesman, the [Khan](:Khan_%28title%29) of [Kazakh Khanate](:Kazakh_Khanate) [Abylai Khan](:Ablai_Khan) located in [Almaty](:Almaty), Kazakhstan."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
