<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mestia_Municipality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Mestia (Georgian: მესტიის მუნიციპალიტეტი, Mesṫiis municiṗaliṫeṫi) is a district of Georgia, in the region of Samegrelo-Zemo Svaneti. Its main town is Mestia. It has an area of 3,045 km2 and had a population of 9,316 at the 2014 census."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Adam_Mickiewicz_Monument,_Lviv> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Adam Mickiewicz Monument**, also known as the **Adam Mickiewicz Column**, ([Polish](:Polish_language): *Kolumna Adama Mickiewicza we Lwowie*, [Ukrainian](:Ukrainian_language): *Пам'ятник Адамові Міцкевичу*), is a [Neo-classical](:Neoclassicism) column commemorating the Polish Romantic poet [Adam Mickiewicz](:Adam_Mickiewicz) (1798–1855) located at the [Mickiewicz Square](:Mickiewicz_Square) in the centre of [Lviv](:Lviv), [Ukraine](:Ukraine), and opened in 1904."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
