<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Soldiers_and_Sailors_Monument_(Watertown,_New_York)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Soldiers and Sailors Monument** in [Watertown, New York](:Watertown%2C_New_York) was erected in 1891 to commemorate local citizens who fought in the [Civil War](:American_Civil_War). The monument rests upon the former village green, which has been located there since 1805."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
