<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mariano_Benlliure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> " **Mariano Benlliure y Gil** (8 September 1862 – 9 November 1947) was a Spanish sculptor and [medallist](:Medallist), who executed many public monuments and religious sculptures in [Spain](:Spain), working in a heroic realist style."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
