<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Qırmızı_Qəsəbə> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Qırmızı Qəsəbə (Gyrmyzy Gasaba; Azerbaijani pronunciation: [ɡɯɾmɯˈzɯ ɡæsæˈbæ]; Hebrew: העיר האדומה, romanized: ha-'Ir ha-'Adumá) or Krasnaya Sloboda (Russian: Красная Слобода; all three meaning \"the Red Town\") is a village and municipality in Quba District of Azerbaijan. It has a population of 3,598, and is believed to be the world's only all-Jewish town outside Israel and the United States."@en .
