<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Halifax,_Nova_Scotia> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Halifax is the capital and largest municipality of the Canadian province of Nova Scotia, and the largest municipality in Atlantic Canada. As of the 2021 Census, the municipal population was 439,819, with 348,634 people in its urban area. The regional municipality consists of four former municipalities that were amalgamated in 1996: Halifax, Dartmouth, Bedford, and Halifax County."@en .
