<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Washington_Monument_(Baltimore)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Washington Monument** is the centerpiece of intersecting Mount Vernon Place and Washington Place, an urban square in the [Mount Vernon-Belvedere](:Mount_Vernon%2C_Baltimore) neighborhood north of downtown [Baltimore](:Baltimore%2C_Maryland), [Maryland](:Maryland). It was the first major monument begun to honor [George Washington](:George_Washington) (1732–1799)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
