<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ireland> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ireland (/ˈaɪərlənd/ YRE-lənd; Irish: Éire [ˈeːɾʲə]; Ulster-Scots: Airlann [ˈɑːrlən]) is an island in the North Atlantic Ocean, in north-western Europe. It is separated from Great Britain to its east by the North Channel, the Irish Sea, and St George's Channel. Ireland is the second-largest island of the British Isles, the third-largest in Europe, and the twentieth-largest on Earth."@en .
